</section><section class="section ingr-section"><div class="section-inner"><p class="s-tag center">What guides us</p><h2 class="s-heading center">Our Principles</h2><div class="ben-left"><div class="ben-card"><div class="ben-icon-wrap ic-green"><i class="fa-solid fa-scale-balanced"></i></div><div><div class="ben-text-h">Balance over elimination</div><p class="ben-text-p">A healthy mouth is a diverse one. We build around supporting it, not sterilizing it.</p></div></div><div class="ben-card"><div class="ben-icon-wrap ic-blue"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i></div><div><div class="ben-text-h">Clear, honest wording</div><p class="ben-text-p">We describe what ingredients are and why they are included, and we avoid promising specific results.</p></div></div><div class="ben-card"><div class="ben-icon-wrap ic-rose"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-doctor"></i></div><div><div class="ben-text-h">Dentists stay central</div><p class="ben-text-p">Every page reminds readers that supplements complement professional care.</p></div></div><div class="ben-card"><div class="ben-icon-wrap ic-teal"><i class="fa-solid fa-flask"></i></div><div><div class="ben-text-h">Ingredients in the open</div><p class="ben-text-p">Every ingredient is listed and explained on our <a href='/ingredients' style='color:var(--green);font-weight:700'>ingredients page</a>.</p></div></div><div class="ben-card"><div class="ben-icon-wrap ic-amber"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i></div><div><div class="ben-text-h">Risk-free trial</div><p class="ben-text-p">A 60-day money-back guarantee lets you decide for yourself.</p></div></div><div class="ben-card"><div class="ben-icon-wrap ic-purple"><i class="fa-solid fa-handshake"></i></div><div><div class="ben-text-h">Real support</div><p class="ben-text-p">Customer support details come with every order confirmation.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section "><div class="section-inner"><p class="s-tag center">The formula</p><h2 class="s-heading center">What Goes Into DentaVive</h2><div class="quote-block" style="max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto"><p>Each capsule combines <i>Lactobacillus reuteri</i>, <i>Lactobacillus paracasei</i>, <i>Bifidobacterium lactis</i> BL-04, <i>Lactobacillus salivarius</i>, and <i>Streptococcus salivarius</i> K12, together with tricalcium phosphate and inulin.</p><p>Read the detailed rationale for each one on the <a href="https://dntavive.com/ingredients" style="color:var(--green);font-weight:700">ingredients page</a>, or see the <a href="https://dntavive.com/en#how-it-works" style="color:var(--green);font-weight:700">How It Works</a> section on the home page.</p></div></div></section><section class="section "><div class="section-inner"><p class="s-tag center">Using supplements wisely</p><h2 class="s-heading center">Our Commitment to Responsible Information</h2><div class="quote-block" style="max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto"><p>Supplement statements have not been evaluated by the U.S. Food and Drug Administration, and DentaVive is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. Individual results vary.</p><p>Our bonus guides and web content are educational. They are not medical or dental advice. See a qualified professional for pain, bleeding, swelling, or any persistent symptom, and consult one before use if you are pregnant, nursing, or on medication.</p></div></div></section><section class="section ingr-section"><div class="section-inner"><p class="s-tag center">Shopping with us</p><h2 class="s-heading center">Official Purchase, Pricing, and Guarantee</h2><div class="quote-block" style="max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto"><p>DentaVive is sold through its official website at three package sizes: two bottles for $158, four bottles for $276, or six bottles for $294. Larger packages lower the per-bottle price, include free US shipping on multi-bottle orders, and every order includes three free bonus guides plus a 60-day money-back guarantee.</p><p><a href="https://dntavive.